# ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
# ┃  Ghostty — Hyprland terminali                              ┃
# ┃  Tema: Catppuccin Mocha + mavi vurgu (Hyprland çerçevesiyle aynı)            ┃
# ┃  Yeniden yükle: Ctrl+Shift+,                                ┃
# ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛

# ── Yazı tipi ────────────────────────────────────────────────
font-family        = JetBrainsMono Nerd Font
font-size          = 11.5
font-thicken       = true
font-feature       = calt
font-feature       = liga
font-feature       = ss02
adjust-cell-height = 12%
bold-is-bright     = true

# ── Renkler ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
theme               = Catppuccin Mocha
background          = #11111b
foreground          = #cdd6f4
cursor-color        = #89b4fa
cursor-text         = #11111b
selection-background = #45475a
selection-foreground = #89b4fa
split-divider-color = #89b4fa
minimum-contrast    = 1.1

# ── Saydamlık / blur (Hyprland blur'u da uygular) ───────────
background-opacity     = 0.78
background-blur        = true
unfocused-split-opacity = 0.6

# ── Pencere ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
window-decoration      = none
gtk-titlebar           = false
window-theme           = dark
window-padding-x       = 14
window-padding-y       = 12
window-padding-balance = true
window-inherit-working-directory = true
gtk-single-instance    = true
confirm-close-surface  = false
quit-after-last-window-closed = true

# ── İmleç / fare ─────────────────────────────────────────────
cursor-style        = bar
cursor-style-blink  = true
mouse-hide-while-typing = true
copy-on-select      = clipboard
clipboard-paste-protection = false
link-url            = true
scrollback-limit    = 20000000

# ── Kabuk entegrasyonu (fish) ───────────────────────────────
shell-integration          = fish
shell-integration-features = cursor,sudo,title,path

# ── Kısayollar (Konsole alışkanlıkları) ─────────────────────
keybind = ctrl+shift+t=new_tab
keybind = ctrl+shift+w=close_surface
keybind = ctrl+shift+right=next_tab
keybind = ctrl+shift+left=previous_tab
keybind = ctrl+shift+enter=new_split:right
keybind = ctrl+shift+d=new_split:down
keybind = alt+left=goto_split:left
keybind = alt+right=goto_split:right
keybind = alt+up=goto_split:up
keybind = alt+down=goto_split:down
keybind = ctrl+shift+f=toggle_fullscreen
keybind = ctrl+plus=increase_font_size:1
keybind = ctrl+minus=decrease_font_size:1
keybind = ctrl+zero=reset_font_size
keybind = ctrl+shift+comma=reload_config
